# Data is regenerated by the scheduled jobs / notebooks, not source — and some
# files here are large or grow daily (yang_zhang_features.parquet, term_structure.parquet,
# manifests). Keep it out of version control; DATA_SCHEMA.md documents what's produced
# and how to regenerate it.
Data/

# Preserved-but-superseded files, including a 228MB CRSP CSV that would exceed
# GitHub's hard file-size limit outright. See deprecated/README.md for rationale.
deprecated/

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ipynb_checkpoints/

.venv/
venv/
env/

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# No longer tracked -- kept on disk locally, not version-controlled.
Reports/
Systematic Commodity Trading Research Report.pdf
CTA Feature Engineering Primer.pdf

# Third-party copyrighted academic papers -- not ours to redistribute.
# The *_implementation_recipe.md notes derived from them are our own work
# and stay tracked.
references/*.pdf

# WisdomTree's own published white paper -- same third-party-copyright reasoning.
Commodities Strategies 2025.pdf

# Point-in-time internal snapshot, not a living document (see CLAUDE.md) --
# its own footer says "not for distribution."
project-review.html

# Raw output from local transform runs -- session artifacts, not source.
databento/*.log
